      "runs_on": "flagtrain-mthreads-s5000-0"
    },
    "note": "Container job on the FlagOS runtime image, like hygon/iluvatar/metax. prebuilt_env is false like every vendor, so setup_env.sh --no-prebuilt installs backends.yaml's torch/torch_musa, the MUSA flagtree and megatron-core on top of the image instead of trusting whatever it ships. mthreads-gmi is bind-mounted read-only from the host because tools/gpu_check_mthreads.sh runs inside the container; drop the -v if the image turns out to carry it already (FlagGems passes the same mount, expressed as container.volumes, which this repo's schema does not have)."
